1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,499
Farzandingiz nasihatingizni emas,

2
00:00:02,549 --> 00:00:04,612
avvalo muomalangizni o'rganadi.

3
00:00:05,462 --> 00:00:07,097
Bola ovozingizdan sabrni,

4
00:00:07,147 --> 00:00:08,445
qo'lingizdan mehrni,

5
00:00:08,495 --> 00:00:10,872
muomalangizdan esa odobni o'rganadi.

6
00:00:11,722 --> 00:00:13,926
Xato qilganda faqat koyish emas,

7
00:00:13,976 --> 00:00:16,814
to'g'ri yo'lni ko'rsatish ham tarbiyadir.

8
00:00:17,663 --> 00:00:20,365
Rasululloh (s.a.v.) aytdilar:

9
00:00:20,894 --> 00:00:21,906
Kim rahm qilmasa,

10
00:00:21,956 --> 00:00:23,217
unga rahm qilinmaydi.

11
00:00:24,067 --> 00:00:26,522
Bir marta ko'proq baqirish o'rniga,

12
00:00:26,572 --> 00:00:29,241
bir marta ko'proq tushuntirib ko'ring.

13
00:00:30,091 --> 00:00:31,753
Mehr bilan berilgan tarbiya

14
00:00:31,803 --> 00:00:33,782
bolaning qalbida uzoqroq qoladi.

15
00:00:34,450 --> 00:00:35,541
Farzandingizga bugun

16
00:00:35,591 --> 00:00:36,854
bir yaxshi so'z ayting.

